; a library whose entries run past its block of 127 numbers while the next
; library number is free (#960): Mildred (library 15, there is no library
; 16) has MProcessor as its entry 206, the token of library 16's entry 78;
; the compiler finds it in Mildred.  The CPU number is not printed, only
; that the function gives one of 0..6 (MC68000..MC68060)
p.w = MProcessor
If p >= 0 AND p <= 6 Then NPrint "cpu ok" Else NPrint "cpu ", p
End
